1. EXPECTED SUBSTITUTIONS -- the manuscript's arithmetic corrected
========================================================================
alignment 110321 bp, dated span 71 years

  at the published mu = 1.0e-05 substitutions/site/year:
    over 25 years    :   27.6 substitutions
    over 71 years    :   78.0 substitutions

  the manuscript states 'about 5' over 25 years and 'about 15' over 71.
  correct values are 27.6 and 78.3: low by 5.5x.
  the quoted pair is internally consistent with a rate of 1.81e-06,
  which is 5.5x below the rate the Methods cite.

  structural divergence across Node_147: 100-250 substitutions
  ratio to the 25-year temporal expectation: 3.6-9.1x
  (the manuscript's figures imply 20-50x)

  The conclusion that structure dominates time survives. Its margin
  does not: state it as a few-fold excess, not an order of magnitude.

